design='''WS-M5-69 prospective design — bounded request residency for packed VLM allocations

Status: design and read-only audit only. WS68 remains a published valid rejection; best validated WS10 stays deployed. No source/build/model/performance change exists for69 yet.

Evidence and distinct hypothesis
Read prior32/33/56 residency reports and actual Context/Session/Model code. Those policies handle RAW BF16 masters; existing Begin explicitly rejects PrimaryReady with reason7, and coverage explicitly rejects packed weights. Original budget4GiB excludes full raw4B. Prior56 text-only admission failed whole-system preservation, and that rejection stands. Existing WS62 hardware-counter capture already covers BOTH models at steps4/16/28: reuse it instead of repeating an unchanged diagnostic. Its 4B warm ranks show MLP projections and vocabulary among substantial sampled custom intervals, not complete GPU shares. WS68 retained prefill/decode GPU-spanning intervals dominate small host encoder/preparation spans but do not prove paging, residency or a kernel cause.

Hypothesis: prepare an explicitly bounded residency set for the existing4B lossless-primary payload AND metadata allocations before fresh vision/input preparation, keep it only through one infer request, and release it after all native work drains. Metal's residency request is a preparatory hint, not a guarantee. It may already do the same work automatically; allocation collection, bookkeeping, residency/coverage/cache/cleanup and memory pressure can outweigh any benefit. No speed or physical-residency gain is established.

Source and profile
Use immutable published WS56 source1720files (290f5742ba51c41197f24179cfee4876e96e789a) to reuse its fully tested lifecycle/coverage design. Its rejected performance stays recorded; do not promote it. Original raw-residency implementation/API/tests/budget remain unchanged. New default-OFF PACKED_REQUEST_WEIGHT_RESIDENCY is separate and mutually exclusive with original raw request residency. New controls use minimal PRIMARY/WIDE/LAZY only; vector/isolation/direct/cached and all later rejected layout/shader options OFF. RAW-to-candidate fourflag contrast; PRIMARY-to-candidate only packed-request feature. Native source/shader programs must be identical RAW/PRIMARY/currentON wherever feature selection does not require the new native lifecycle; all floating math/order, BF16 values/layout/metadata, graph/session operation boundaries, precision, model/token/pixel/prefix policies and CUDA/engine remain unchanged.

Native implementation contract
Add separate packed Context/Session APIs, state and counters; preserve old raw APIs and their disabled behavior, not an implicit reinterpretation of old methods. Reuse generated copies of existing bounded lease/coverage algorithms with explicit name/admission transformations and inverse proof. No shader or codec change, no extra weight copy/cache/private staging, no new queue/dispatch/wait. New budget is8GiB per device within this Garnet runtime, chosen BEFORE implementation from full201payload+metadata inventory6,402,163,712bytes. Unique-allocation cap2048 unchanged. Structural expectation402allocations must be checked against actual runtime ownership/allocatedSize BEFORE timing; owner counts are not physical residency. Budget does not bound unrelated libraries/processes or guarantee resident bytes.

Collect actual supplied decoder-layer/head primary owners under existing sorted graph/session locks. Include BOTH primaryPayload/primaryMetadata of each eligible owner, validate device/representation/length/overflow before acquiring, deduplicate actual MTLBuffer identities, retain strong logical weight owners through every submitted/partial command. Raw small matrices and all F32/vision/state/transient allocations stay automatically managed and are excluded from this set. Pure raw/narrow/empty/unsupported/oversize/busy cases fall back without changing model math/state. Mixed graphs ignore unleased RAW buffers for packed-coverage checks but still validate original graph ownership and controls. Packed coverage checks must require BOTH allocations, not only payload or logical name. Track actual graph generation/strong owner retention/bounded256graph coverage cache. Uncovered or rebuilt packed owners cancel the hint safely before use; no stale pointer/cache admission. All old graph/invalid-input/host-private invariants remain.

New set attaches only to decoder queue, commit/requestResidency before fresh vision/input processing where possible AFTER ordinary decoder.reset, not after the timed interval. It spans prefill and decode, then detach/end/removeAll/commit/clear strong owners/release budget only after SubmitAndWait or drained Abort. Reset/Close/destructor/fault/partial submission clean up; End is idempotent and refuses undrained commands. No persistent graph/weight pin after request. New native tests use original64KiB test-only budget with a valid compact260x128fixture to exercise admission/contention/recovery; measured build remains8GiB with hooks OFF. Unsupported OS/cross-GPU branches source-preserved; do not claim runtime execution on this single M5.

Serving integration and timing
Keep old raw-residency Model path byte/inverse exact under old flag. New Model constructor may cache eligibility from actual compiled graph.wide_primary_eligible, recomputed on model construction/reload, never hardcode model IDs. Narrow companion must skip Begin/End and packed graph traversal entirely. General native API still validates actual owners and handles empty fallback. After ordinary reset, wrap new eligible lease plus all image/input/prefill/decode work in try/finally. Image/tokenizer/capacity/graph/GPU/stop errors release it. Original wrapper clocks stay; TTFT includes preparation/hint work, total and whole-Skill wall include cleanup and new telemetry. Postrequest stats once, no per-token getters; native active/globalbytes/scope0 after cleanup, admitted/calls/ends/source tuple must be actual. Keep original in-decode snapshots and label any separate postcleanup snapshot rather than replacing it. No hidden retry.

Correctness before any speed test
Preserve original native projection records and original FP64 bounds across RAW/PRIMARY/ON/FAULT/COMPAT56. Original raw request native/fault tests still pass in compatibility; new packed tests cover two allocations/owner, duplicates, raw/empty fallback, count/byte/global caps, overflow/device checks, unsupported API, busy/readmission, owner/source release, two/many batches, covered/shared/uncovered/rebuilt/closed graphs, head variants, partialSubmit/Abort/poisonReset, all cross-thread/nesting/Reset/Close behaviors and reserve/attach/emit/error recovery. Verify setup itself without dispatching performance. Actual all201packed matrices/five existing GPU word readers,245rawHOST and546direct words stay; full32VLM28text finite states/tokens/vision/private/shared/prefix/capacity/error/reload oracles unchanged. Actual4B lease must match complete unique primary payload+metadata coverage including lazy shared prefill graphs, no uncovered fallback in normal infer and zero active/global bytes after every normal/error call. Companion skip must be native-evidenced, not inferred from a label. Keep existing math/oracle/threshold ASTs; only explicit feature admission/role mappings may change. Freeze all consumed inputs and verifiers before learned execution, with generated outputs excluded.

Original actual WorldSense gates
Use fixed video-derived files/no camera. Full input/config/budget identity: VLM64,text16,capacity2048,image65536,sharedvision,bounded64token/twoentry/64MiBtextprefix; fresh image preparation/encoding, no image/answer reuse or speculation. Four actualWorldSense/Galaxy functional calls first, ineligible for speed. Fresh resource8 requires>=10%Metal and>=5%process footprint reduction versusRAW. Actual selectedWS10screen20 requires all per-model TTFT/total/deriveddecode andwholeSkillwall within2%. Mandatory matchedPRIMARY20 requires>=5%4BTTFT gain AND unchanged2%per-model/wall/Metal/process-footprint preservation. RAW20, mirrored48(eachpair independently) then canonical integration/rebuild/fullproof+48actualWS10/app smoke all remain mandatory. Valid fail stops later stages/no unchanged retry/pooled rescue. Keep WS10 until every gate passes. No consumed edits, builds, competing GPU work or archive copying during timing, only bounded observations; preserve authoritative session/terminal statuses.

Research record and limits
Save exact methods, input/model/library/source/build/runtime/SDK identities, all first/warm/failures/full outputs, request lease allocation/counter and lifetime evidence, cleanup/init/CPU/memory costs and decisions. Process/Metal snapshots are not peaks/freeRAM/physical residency. GPU/wait spans overlap, medians nonadditive; deriveddecode includes host/stop/postloop/possibleEOS/snapshots. No hardware-cold, significance, thermal/VM/cache/ISA cause or isolated speedup from source/old cross-cohort ratios. Current fixedframe Skill tests exclude live decode/scheduling/event persistence/sharedstates/retrieval/ranking/navigation/independentcamera fusion. M5/24GiB/4B is separate from unmetM4mini/smallmodel/vLLM handover. Full optimization stays active; no global optimum claim.

Official API source
https://developer.apple.com/documentation/metal/mtlresidencyset/requestresidency() and https://developer.apple.com/documentation/metal/simplifying-gpu-resource-management-with-residency-sets . Apple's preparatory API semantics are a constraint, not evidence of speed or physical residency. Read exact local SDK signatures and availability before implementation.
'''
